# A card exiled "until [a permanent] leaves the battlefield" returns immediately after that permanent leaves (CR 610.3),
# partway through the resolution that made it leave (CR 608.2), not once the resolution is over. Bot2's Temporary Lockdown
# has exiled Bot2's own Sazh's Chocobo ("Landfall - Whenever a land you control enters, put a +1/+1 counter on this
# creature"). Bot1's Assassin's Trophy destroys the Lockdown: the Chocobo is back on the battlefield at once, before the
# Trophy's next instruction has Bot2 search for a basic land and put it onto the battlefield, so the Chocobo sees the
# Forest enter and gets its counter. Had it come back only after the resolution, the Forest would have entered first and
# nothing would have triggered.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Assassin's Trophy
Forest
Swamp x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Sazh's Chocobo
Black Lotus
Temporary Lockdown
Island
Island
Island
Island
Forest
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Sazh's Chocobo.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot2.Hand.Temporary Lockdown.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Exile = Sazh's Chocobo
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Assassin's Trophy.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Temporary Lockdown)
Bot2.Accept
Bot2.Search(Forest)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Temporary Lockdown; Black Lotus
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Forest; Sazh's Chocobo
Bot2.Battlefield.Sazh's Chocobo.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
